  "descriptions": {
    "preferred": "As the name implies (murasaki means \"purple\" and hime means \"dwarf\"), this cultivar is a purple-leaved dwarf. It purple becomes green red inside the plant where the leaves are shaded. Color tones vary within the plant. This cultivar seems a little delicate and not vigorous. The name has been misspelled"
